  Reason: nested QualityVerdict in BrainDecision requires Pro reliability

Workers: gemini-3-flash-preview (default)
  temperature: 1.0 (creative output benefits from higher temp)
  Override in config.py agent_llm_overrides if a specific worker is unstable

